content.text:
仓库完整跑通了(toy 数据),原始数据链接已失效。

```json
{
  "paper_url": "https://aclanthology.org/P17-1033/",
  "entrypoint": {"command": "python tdlm_train.py && python tdlm_test.py -m output/toy-model/ -d data/toy-valid.txt --print_perplexity", "source": "README 'Running the code' / example.sh"},
  "env_analysis": {
    "python_version_required": "2.7",
    "framework_required": "tensorflow 0.8-0.12 (+ gensim)",
    "evidence": "README Requirements 段明示 python2.7 + tensorflow 0.8-0.12;代码用 cPickle、print 语句风格,确认 py2"
  },
  "external_apis": [],
  "data": {
    "datasets_needed": ["AP News", "BNC", "IMDB", "toy (repo 内置)"],
    "toy_data_in_repo": true,
    "status": [
      {"dataset": "toy-train/toy-valid", "state": "in_repo", "source": "data/toy-train.txt, data/toy-valid.txt", "version_uncertain": false},
      {"dataset": "AP News+BNC+IMDB bundle", "state": "link_dead", "source": "https://ibm.box.com/s/ls61p8ovc1y87w45oa02zink2zl7l6z4 → HTTP 404;WebSearch 未找到作者提供的替代镜像", "version_uncertain": true},
      {"dataset": "BNC", "state": "licensed", "source": "BNC 需签使用协议 (Oxford Text Archive),即使绕过 box 链接也无法自动获取", "version_uncertain": false}
    ],
    "used_for_smoke": "toy"
  },
  "docker": {
    "images_tried": ["tensorflow/tensorflow:0.12.1", "python:2.7"],
    "image_used": "python:2.7",
    "pull_success": true,
    "run_command": "docker run --rm -v /tmp/tdlm:/repo -w /repo python:2.7 bash -c \"pip install -q tensorflow==0.12.1 'gensim<4' 'numpy<1.17' 'scipy<1.3'; python tdlm_train.py; python tdlm_test.py -m output/toy-model/ -d data/toy-valid.txt --print_perplexity\""
  },
  "install": {"status": "success", "log_tail": "('0.12.1', '3.8.3') — tensorflow 0.12.1 cp27 wheel 仍在 PyPI。注:官方 tensorflow/tensorflow:0.12.1 镜像(Ubuntu14.04/py2.7.6)因 TLS 过旧无法访问 PyPI 装 gensim('No matching distribution found'),换 python:2.7 镜像后解决。gensim 3.8.3 对 numpy<=1.16.1 有版本告警,不影响运行。"},
  "run": {
    "command": "python tdlm_train.py (epoch_size=1, toy config) 然后 tdlm_test.py --print_perplexity",
    "status": "success",
    "output_tail": "Vocab size = 2786 / Train corpus: no. of docs = 100, topic model no. of sequences = 7051, language model no. of sequences = 1877 ... 训练完成后输出各温度下的 topic 条件生成句子;评测:\ntest topic model perplexity = 2144.436\ntest language model perplexity = 893.854"
  },
  "smoke_verdict": "smoke_passed_toy",
  "all_blockers": [
    {"verdict": "blocked_data_link_dead", "confirmed_by": "static", "detail": "README 提供的论文数据集(AP News / BNC / IMDB)唯一下载地址 https://ibm.box.com/s/ls61p8ovc1y87w45oa02zink2zl7l6z4 返回 HTTP 404,搜索未找到作者镜像;其中 BNC 本身还需签署使用协议。因此无法用论文真实数据做 smoke test。"}
  ],
  "blocker_attribution": "genuine",
  "verdict_reason": "代码链路在 python:2.7 + TF 0.12.1 容器里完整跑通(训练→保存模型→评测输出 perplexity),零代码修改;唯一问题是论文数据集的 IBM Box 链接已 404,只能用仓库自带 toy 数据。"
}
```

Sources: [GitHub jhlau/topically-driven-language-model](https://github.com/jhlau/topically-driven-language-model), [ACL Anthology P17-1033](https://aclanthology.org/P17-1033/)

